  "description": "Fail-closed upload validation for .NET: real content-type checking, bounded structural PDF parsing, recursive embedded-file inspection, and active-content detection for PDF/Office/CSV/images. PDF parsing runs in an isolated worker process by default (a PdfPig stack overflow cannot take down the host). Optional pluggable antivirus via IVirusScanner. Defense-in-depth, not a malware certificate or certified CDR.",
